/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Teamworking\040and\040knowledge\040management\072\040a\040review\040of\040converging\040themes)
/Author (Jonathan\040Sapsed\054\040John\040Bessant\054\040David\040Partington\054\040David\040Tranfield\054\040Malcolm\040Young)
/Subject (The\040teamworking\040and\040knowledge\040management\040fields\040are\040increasingly\040converging\056\040Teamworking\040is\040turned\040to\040with\040a\040growing\040disillusion\040with\040knowledge\040management\040approaches\040that\040are\040seen\040as\040excessively\040\217hard\220\054\040\217objectified\220\054\040or\040\217information\040technology\040dominated\220\056\040This\040paper\040is\040a\040critical\040review\054\040the\040purpose\040of\040which\040is\040to\040survey\040the\040literature\040across\040several\040fields\040that\040provide\040insights\040into\040teamworking\040aspects\040of\040knowledge\040management\054\040and\040the\040reverse\056\040This\040approach\040is\040chosen\040as\040disciplines\040tend\040to\040sustain\040presumptions\040and\040preoccupations\040that\040may\040be\040contradicted\040by\040other\040fields\054\040as\040is\040shown\056\040In\040particular\054\040the\040review\040challenges\040what\040is\040referred\040to\040as\040the\040\217organizational\040behaviour\040textbook\040theory\040of\040teamworking\220\040and\040refers\040to\040research\040and\040theory\040from\040several\040disciplines\040that\040qualify\040what\040is\040still\040an\040influential\040orthodoxy\056\040The\040paper\040attempts\040to\040draw\040together\040some\040principles\040from\040current\040themes\040such\040as\040collective\040mind\054\040modularity\054\040cross\055functional\040teams\040and\040communities\040of\040practice\056)
/Keywords (01\040Mar\0402002\054\040International\040Journal\040of\040Management\040Reviews\054\040University\040of\040Brighton\054\040Cranfield\040University)
>>
